# Shell scripts and Python must keep LF even when checked out on Windows:
# this project runs under WSL, and a CRLF shebang makes the interpreter
# unfindable with a confusing "bad interpreter" error.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf

# Markdown documents in this repo are mostly Chinese prose; diffing them by
# word rather than by line keeps changes readable.
*.md diff
